# Model pair

`AGENTS.md` wins. Spawn a second model only when the user asks.

## Roles

- **Implementer** (Grok 4.6 groups by default): patch SoT and real package files. Own the write if both would touch the same path.
- **Mapper** (GPT 5.6 Luna 1M Max by default): wide consumer/duplicate/prelude scan. Return `CONFLICTS` / `SAFE_FIRST_FIXES` / `DO_NOT_TOUCH`. Do not rewrite SoT.

Same roles apply to GLM / Claude / others when the user names them.

## Shared

- Tokens: `.cursor/rules/design-tokens.mdc`. Library: `.cursor/rules/library-contracts.mdc`.
- Edit real files only. Alias leftover names. One implementation.
- Preserve wallpaper / `data-theme` / markdown contrast unless that theme is the task.

## Handoff

Mapper reports. Implementer applies one SoT or named-consumer patch. Mapper re-checks only that surface.
